{"user": "I remember playing 'c8' earlier. Was that a bad move, or did it at least help a bit?", "user_ts": "2026-08-10T22:06:00.891334+00:00", "assistant": "Hard to judge without the exact position then, but from the final board:\n\n- **c8 ended up White**, so your Black disc there was **flipped back**.\n- White also owns **a8** and most of the bottom edge, so **c8 did not become stable** for you.\n\nSo it probably **helped only temporarily** by flipping discs, but it didn\u2019t help the final score much.\n\nThe key question at the time would be: **Did c8 allow White to take a8 or secure the bottom edge?** If yes, then it was likely a costly move. If no, it may just have been a reasonable move that didn\u2019t hold up.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-10T22:06:00.891334+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-10T22:06:05.891334+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 2, "Common Ground Question": 3, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 1}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 0.6666666666666666, "Common Ground Question": 1.0, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question", "Common Ground Question"], "sonnet": ["Common Ground Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "consensus": ["Board Report", "Local Justification", "Prompt", "Neutral Feedback"], "votes": {"Board Report": 3, "Prompt": 2, "Neutral Feedback": 3, "Local Justification": 2, "Hint": 1}, "confidence": {"Board Report": 1.0, "Prompt": 0.6666666666666666, "Neutral Feedback": 1.0, "Local Justification": 0.6666666666666666, "Hint": 0.3333333333333333}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Board Report", "Prompt", "Neutral Fee